			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 1,
			"text": "Practising kindness towards oneself \nand others stimulates serotonin which \ncalms anxiety and acts as a natural \nantidepressant.",
			"rawText": "Practising kindness towards oneself and others stimulates serotonin which calms anxiety and acts as a natural antidepressant.",
			"baseline": 92,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "xu8nS_5Jmp5-5mGFpJ5Rs",
			"originalText": "Practising kindness towards oneself and others stimulates serotonin which calms anxiety and acts as a natural antidepressant."
		},
